Generate {{ num_docs }} English texts where address-like strings and organization-like strings are easy to confuse.

## Purpose
Measure ADDRESS vs ORGANIZATION confusion when names contain place words, branch words, or office words.

## PII Tag Format
- `<PERSON>John Carter</PERSON>`
- `<ADDRESS>205 Lake Street, Chicago, IL</ADDRESS>`
- `<ORGANIZATION>West Loop Data Lab</ORGANIZATION>`
- `<DATE_OF_BIRTH>1988-06-15</DATE_OF_BIRTH>`
- `<BANK_ACCOUNT>Chase Bank Midtown Branch Checking 1234567</BANK_ACCOUNT>`

## Concrete Patterns

### 1. Place words inside org names
- `<ORGANIZATION>West Loop Data Lab</ORGANIZATION> ships to <ADDRESS>205 Lake Street, Chicago, IL</ADDRESS>`
- `<ORGANIZATION>North Harbor Medical Association</ORGANIZATION> / <ADDRESS>19 King Street, Denver, CO</ADDRESS>`
- `<ORGANIZATION>South Market Legal Office</ORGANIZATION> / <ADDRESS>123 Market Street, San Francisco, CA</ADDRESS>`

### 2. Branch / office switching
- `<BANK_ACCOUNT>Citibank West Branch Checking 3344556</BANK_ACCOUNT> belongs to <PERSON>Mia Lopez</PERSON>`
- `Meet outside West Branch Office` is untagged, but `<ORGANIZATION>West Branch Support LLC</ORGANIZATION>` is tagged
- `<ORGANIZATION>Midtown Headquarters Systems</ORGANIZATION> is located at <ADDRESS>44 Pine Road, Seattle, WA</ADDRESS>`

### 3. Untagged facility-like phrases in the same text
- `North Harbor campus entrance` stays untagged, but `<ORGANIZATION>North Harbor Health Network</ORGANIZATION>` is tagged
- `Lake Street office block` stays untagged, but `<ADDRESS>205 Lake Street, Chicago, IL</ADDRESS>` is tagged
- `Downtown branch lobby` stays untagged, but `<ORGANIZATION>Downtown Branch Operations Inc.</ORGANIZATION>` is tagged

### 4. Supporting person / date / account cues
- `<PERSON>Olivia Reed</PERSON> (<DATE_OF_BIRTH>1990/03/15</DATE_OF_BIRTH>) works at <ORGANIZATION>Blue Harbor Systems Inc.</ORGANIZATION>`
- `<PERSON>Grace Kim</PERSON> ships to <ADDRESS>77 Harbor Way, Boston, MA</ADDRESS>`
- `Deposit via <BANK_ACCOUNT>Bank of America South Branch Checking 4567890</BANK_ACCOUNT>`

## Output Format
- Separate each text with `---DOC_SEPARATOR---`
- Each text should be 80-240 characters
- Each text must include at least 1 ADDRESS and 1 ORGANIZATION
